<!DOCTYPE html> <html lang="en"> <head> <meta charset="UTF-8"> <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0"> <title>Hazem & Salma | Wedding Invitation</title> <style> * { box-sizing: border-box; } :root { --black: #100d10; --burgundy: #701d35; --gold: #d7b66c; --cream: #f8eddf; } html { scroll-behavior: smooth; } body { margin: 0; background: var(--black); color: var(--cream); text-align: center; font-family: Georgia, "Times New Roman", serif; } .hero { min-height: 100vh; padding: 55px 22px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; justify-content: center; position: relative; background: radial-gradient(ellipse at center, #431824 0%, #211117 48%, #100d10 85%); } .hero:before { content: ""; position: absolute; inset: 14px; border: 1px solid #9b7843; pointer-events: none; } .eyebrow { color: var(--gold); letter-spacing: 4px; font: 11px Arial, sans-serif; } .heart { color: var(--gold); font-size: 36px; margin: 30px 0 12px; } h1 { font-size: clamp(43px, 10vw, 70px); font-weight: normal; line-height: 1.18; margin: 15px 0; } .amp { color: var(--gold); font-style: italic; } .subtitle { color: var(--gold); font: 11px Arial, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 5px; margin: 20px 0 28px; } .line { width: 95px; height: 1px; background: var(--gold); margin: 0 auto 26px; } .date { color: var(--gold); font-size: 30px; letter-spacing: 3px; } .time { font: 14px Arial, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 2px; margin-top: 20px; } .quote { color: #d2c1c2; font-size: 15px; font-style: italic; line-height: 1.9; margin: 28px 0; } .btn { display: inline-block; padding: 13px 24px; background: var(--burgundy); border: 1px solid var(--gold); border-radius: 30px; color: var(--cream); text-decoration: none; font: 12px Arial, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 1px; cursor: pointer; margin-top: 12px; } .section { max-width: 620px; padding: 55px 22px; margin: auto; } .section h2 { color: var(--gold); font-size: 27px; font-weight: normal; } .section p { color: #d2c1c2; font: 14px/1.9 Arial, sans-serif; } .card { background: #1c1318; border: 1px solid #65404b; border-radius: 13px; padding: 25px 18px; margin-top: 22px; } .countdown { display: flex; justify-content: center; gap: 8px; margin-top: 25px; } .count-box { background: #24151b; border: 1px solid #72513b; border-radius: 9px; padding: 14px 4px; width: 75px; } .count-box strong { color: var(--gold); font-size: 24px; font-weight: normal; display: block; } .count-box span { font: 9px Arial, sans-serif; color: #d2c1c2; display: block; margin-top: 7px; } .field { display: block; width: 100%; padding: 14px; margin: 12px 0; border-radius: 7px; border: 1px solid #65404b; background: #100d10; color: white; font: 14px Arial, sans-serif; } textarea.field { min-height: 110px; resize: vertical; } .wish { text-align: left; overflow-wrap: anywhere; background: #24151b; border-left: 2px solid var(--gold); border-radius: 5px; padding: 15px; margin-top: 12px; } .wish strong { color: var(--gold); display: block; margin-bottom: 8px; } .wish p { white-space: pre-wrap; margin: 0; } .note { font: 12px/1.8 Arial, sans-serif !important; color: #b9a7ad !important; } footer { padding: 30px 15px; border-top: 1px solid #432530; color: var(--gold); font-size: 13px; letter-spacing: 2px; } @media(max-width:360px) { .count-box { width: 65px; } .countdown { gap: 5px; } } </style> </head> <body> <header class="hero"> <div class="eyebrow">A CELEBRATION OF LOVE</div> <div class="heart">♡</div> <p class="eyebrow">TOGETHER WITH OUR FAMILIES</p> <h1> Hazem <span class="amp">&</span><br> Salma </h1> <div class="subtitle">ARE GETTING MARRIED</div> <div class="line"></div> <div class="date">26 · 03 · 2027</div> <p class="time">FRIDAY · 8:00 PM – 12:00 AM</p> <p class="quote"> Two hearts, one beautiful beginning.<br> We can't wait to celebrate with you. </p> <a class="btn" href="#details">OPEN INVITATION ↓</a> </header> <main> <section class="section" id="details"> <h2>Our Special Day</h2> <p>A beautiful night, a new beginning, and the people we love.</p> <div class="card"> <div class="eyebrow">THE WEDDING</div> <h2>Hazem & Salma</h2> <div class="line"></div> <p>Friday, March 26, 2027</p> <p>From 8:00 PM until 12:00 AM</p> </div> <h2 style="margin-top:40px">Counting Down to Forever</h2> <div class="countdown"> <div class="count-box"> <strong id="days">---</strong> <span>DAYS</span> </div> <div class="count-box"> <strong id="hours">--</strong> <span>HOURS</span> </div> <div class="count-box"> <strong id="minutes">--</strong> <span>MINUTES</span> </div> <div class="count-box"> <strong id="seconds">--</strong> <span>SECONDS</span> </div> </div> </section> <section class="section" id="venue"> <h2>Where We Say “I Do”</h2> <p>Join us for our wedding celebration.</p> <div class="card"> <div class="heart">⌖</div> <h2>La Rose Wedding Hall</h2> <p>Alexandria, Egypt</p> <a class="btn" href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=قاعة+لاروز+للافراح+العصافرة+الاسكندرية" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"> OPEN GOOGLE MAPS ↗ </a> <p class="note"> Please confirm the exact venue location before sharing. </p> </div> </section> <section class="section" id="wishes"> <h2>Leave Us a Wish</h2> <p>Your kind words will make our day even more special.</p> <form id="wishForm" class="card"> <input class="field" id="guestName" type="text" maxlength="60" placeholder="Your name" required> <textarea class="field" id="guestMessage" maxlength="500" placeholder="Write your congratulations..." required></textarea> <button class="btn" type="submit"> SEND YOUR WISH ♡ </button> </form> <div id="wishesList" aria-live="polite"></div> <p class="note"> Wishes are currently saved in this browser only. An online database is needed for all guests to see each other's messages. </p> </section> </main> <footer> WITH LOVE, HAZEM & SALMA <p>♡ 26 · 03 · 2027 ♡</p> </footer> <script> const weddingDate = new Date("2027-03-26T20:00:00+02:00").getTime(); function updateCountdown() { let remaining = weddingDate - Date.now(); if (remaining < 0) remaining = 0; document.getElementById("days").textContent = Math.floor(remaining / 86400000); document.getElementById("hours").textContent = Math.floor((remaining % 86400000) / 3600000); document.getElementById("minutes").textContent = Math.floor((remaining % 3600000) / 60000); document.getElementById("seconds").textContent = Math.floor((remaining % 60000) / 1000); } updateCountdown(); setInterval(updateCountdown, 1000); const form = document.getElementById("wishForm"); const list = document.getElementById("wishesList"); function loadWishes() { let wishes = []; try { wishes = JSON.parse( localStorage.getItem("hazemSalmaWishes") || "[]" ); if (!Array.isArray(wishes)) wishes = []; } catch (error) { wishes = []; } list.replaceChildren(); wishes.slice().reverse().forEach(function(wish) { const box = document.createElement("div"); box.className = "wish"; const name = document.createElement("strong"); name.textContent = wish.name; const message = document.createElement("p"); message.textContent = wish.message; box.append(name, message); list.appendChild(box); }); } form.addEventListener("submit", function(event) { event.preventDefault(); const name = document.getElementById("guestName") .value.trim(); const message = document.getElementById("guestMessage") .value.trim(); if (!name || !message) return; let wishes = []; try { wishes = JSON.parse( localStorage.getItem("hazemSalmaWishes") || "[]" ); if (!Array.isArray(wishes)) wishes = []; } catch (error) { wishes = []; } wishes.push({ name: name, message: message }); try { localStorage.setItem( "hazemSalmaWishes", JSON.stringify(wishes) ); } catch (error) { alert("Could not save the wish in this browser."); return; } form.reset(); loadWishes(); }); loadWishes(); </script> </body> </html> 
